          "type": "text",
          "text": "Quality inspectors considered heavy seasonal rainfall while preparing a capacity check for the forest ranger outpost. Rangers assemble the shelter from parts carried on foot. The design must also be explained clearly in the safety briefing. An open hemisphere has radius 10 cm. Its curved surface area is "
